a href=\"https://info.propertylist.es/2024/10/24/\" class=\"meta-item date\">\n                    <ion-icon name=\"calendar-outline\"></ion-icon>\n                    October 24, 2024</a></div><div class=\"text post_tag\"><br><a href=\"https://info.propertylist.es/2024/10/24/\" class=\"meta-item date\"></a><h2><span style=\"font-size: 20px; text-transform: uppercase; color: rgb(11, 18, 32);\">A New Five-Star Gem for Marbella</span></h2><div class=\"modal fade\" id=\"docy_share\" tabindex=\"-3\" role=\"dialog\" aria-hidden=\"false\"><div class=\"modal-dialog\" role=\"document\"><div class=\"modal-content\"><div class=\"docy-share-wrap\">\n                    <div class=\"social-links\">\n                        <a href=\"/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection#\" target=\"_blank\">\n                            <em class=\"icon_mail\"></em>\n                        </a>\n                        <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/share.php?u=https://info.propertylist.es/general-information/a-new-five-star-gem-for-marbella/\"><em class=\"social_facebook_circle\"></em></a>\n                        <a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/shareArticle?mini=true&amp;url=https://info.propertylist.es/general-information/a-new-five-star-gem-for-marbella/\"><em class=\"social_linkedin_square\"></em></a>\n                        <a href=\"https://twitter.com/share?url=https://info.propertylist.es/general-information/a-new-five-star-gem-for-marbella/&amp;text=A New Five-Star Gem for Marbella &amp;hashtags=https://info.propertylist.es\"><em class=\"social_twitter\"></em></a>\n                    </div>\n                    <p><strong style=\"color: rgb(11, 18, 32);\"><br></strong></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(11, 18, 32);\">Costa del Sol is set to sparkle with a brand-new luxury hotel!</strong><span style=\"color: rgb(11, 18, 32);\"> The Meliá Marbella Banús, a beloved four-star property in Nueva Andalucía, is undergoing a major transformation. With an investment of over eight million euros, the hotel is poised to elevate its status to a dazzling five-star experience.</span></p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"blog_area tip_doc_area\" id=\"sticky_doc2\"><div class=\"container\"><div class=\"row\"><div class=\"col-lg-8 blog_single_info\"><div class=\"main-post \"><div class=\"blog_single_item editor-content\"><div data-elementor-type=\"wp-post\" data-elementor-id=\"12275\" class=\"elementor elementor-12275\"><div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-4fb9a5c e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"4fb9a5c\" data-element_type=\"container\"><div class=\"e-con-inner\"><div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-14e1dae elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"14e1dae\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\"><div class=\"elementor-widget-container\"><div class=\"markdown markdown-main-panel response-optimization\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<p data-sourcepos=\"5:1-5:352\">This exciting project has received the green light from Marbella’s town hall, a testament to the town’s commitment to maintaining its reputation as a premier tourist destination. The renovation will encompass a complete overhaul of the hotel’s interior and exterior, including a significant expansion of its accommodations to offer 200 luxurious rooms.</p>\n<p data-sourcepos=\"7:1-7:384\"><strong>Beyond the luxurious rooms, guests can anticipate a refreshing update to the hotel’s swimming pool area.</strong> While the existing pool will receive a makeover, the hotel’s plans include the addition of two brand-new pools in the southern section of the property. This expansion will provide guests with even more opportunities to relax and soak up the sun in Marbella’s idyllic climate.</p>\n<p data-sourcepos=\"9:1-9:299\"><strong>The Meliá Marbella Banús’s transformation is not only a win for guests but also a significant boost for Marbella’s tourism industry.</strong> As the deputy mayor, Félix Romero, proudly stated, “This investment reinforces our town’s position as a leader in the Spanish Mediterranean coast’s hotel sector.”</p>\n<p data-sourcepos=\"11:1-11:342\"><strong>But the Meliá Marbella Banús isn’t the only project revitalizing Marbella’s landscape.</strong> In September alone, the town hall approved over a hundred building and planning permits, representing a total investment of 18 million euros. These projects include the construction of multi-family homes and various other developments across the town.</p>\n<p data-sourcepos=\"13:1-13:467\"><strong>Marbella’s commitment to sustainable and smart development is evident in these initiatives.</strong></p>\n<p data-sourcepos=\"13:1-13:467\">The town is actively working to enhance its urban landscape while preserving its natural beauty. With exciting projects like the <a href=\"https://www.melia.com/es/hoteles/espana/costa-del-sol\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Meliá Marbella Banús</a> renovation and the numerous other developments in the pipeline, Marbella is well-positioned to continue attracting visitors from around the world and solidifying its status as a leading destination for luxury and leisure.</p>\n</div>\n<p data-sourcepos=\"13:1-13:467\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p data-sourcepos=\"13:1-13:467\"><strong>Intrigued by the exciting developments in Marbella and looking to explore more property options in the stunning region of Andalucia?</strong> Head over to PropertyList.es, your one-stop shop for discovering the latest and greatest properties across Andalucia. Whether you’re seeking a luxurious beachfront villa, a charming town center apartment, or a peaceful rural retreat, <a href=\"https://propertylist.es\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">PropertyList.es</a> has something to suit every taste and budget. <strong>Start planning your dream Andalucian escape today!<br><br></strong></p>\n<p data-sourcepos=\"13:1-13:467\"><a href=\"https://propertylist.es\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">www.PropertyList.es</a></p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></section>\n</div> <!-- Body Wrapper -->\n\n    <a id=\"back-to-top\" title=\"Back to Top\" class=\"right\"></a>\n        <div id=\"reading-progress\"><div id=\"reading-progress-fill\"></div></div>\n    <template id=\"tp-language\" data-tp-language=\"en_GB\"></template><div class=\"trp_model_container\" id=\"trp_ald_modal_container\" style=\"display: none\" data-no-dynamic-translation=\"\" data-no-translation=\"\">\n        <div class=\"trp_ald_modal\" id=\"trp_ald_modal_popup\">\n            <div id=\"trp_ald_popup_text\"></div>\n\n        <div class=\"trp_ald_select_and_button\">\n            <div class=\"trp_ald_ls_container\">\n            <div class=\"trp-language-switcher trp-language-switcher-container\" id=\"trp_ald_popup_select_container\" data-no-translation=\"\">\n                \n                <div class=\"trp-ls-shortcode-current-language\" id=\"en_GB\" special-selector=\"trp_ald_popup_current_language\" data-trp-ald-selected-language=\"en_GB\">\n                    <img class=\"trp-flag-image lazyload\" data-src=\"https://info.propertylist.es/wp-content/plugins/translatepress-multilingual/assets/images/flags/en_GB.png\" width=\"18\" height=\"12\" alt=\"en_GB\" title=\"English\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAAAAACH5BAEKAAEALAAAAAABAAEAAAICTAEAOw==\" style=\"--smush-placeholder-width: 18px; --smush-placeholder-aspect-ratio: 18/12;\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\">                 </div>\n                <div class=\"trp-ls-shortcode-language\">\n                    <div class=\"trp-ald-popup-select\" id=\"en_GB\" data-trp-ald-selected-language=\"en_GB\">\n                        <img class=\"trp-flag-image lazyload\" data-src=\"https://info.propertylist.es/wp-content/plugins/translatepress-multilingual/assets/images/flags/en_GB.png\" width=\"18\" height=\"12\" alt=\"en_GB\" title=\"English\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAAAAACH5BAEKAAEALAAAAAABAAEAA